  <Itf Name="IOpModes" Id="{c1f2797f-f549-45c1-a560-37e48f5da3ed}">
    <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary
This interface defines the methods needed for the mode delegates. Mandatory mode methods must be implemented for all nodes.

