    <Method Name="enterNewMode" Id="{2a41962b-096d-48bd-92ce-cae06d36e9aa}" FolderPath="NonMandatory\">
      <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary
This method will be called once before a new mode is started. The method is called for exactly one cycle and
is therefore suitable for triggering events or sending messages to MES systems.
If the node should do nothing when changing the mode, leave it empty.

legal notes
=================
| SPDX-FileCopyrightText: © 2024 ekvip automation GmbH <info@ekvip.de>
