| For details check: Apache-2.0_

.. _Apache-2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

.. </legal notes>  

*)
METHOD enterNewMode
]]></Declaration>
    </Method>
    <Method Name="exitCurrentMode" Id="{1ec4ad52-3b95-4b4e-a111-bd82369a91af}" FolderPath="NonMandatory\">
      <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary
This method will be called once after a mdoe was finished (stopped). The method is called for exactly one cycle and
is therefore suitable for triggering events or sending messages to MES systems.
If the node should do nothing when changing the mode, leave it empty.

