.. </legal notes>  

*)
METHOD runHoming : CNM_ReturnTypes.SingleExecutionState
VAR_INPUT
	execute :BOOL;
	pause :BOOL;
END_VAR
]]></Declaration>
    </Method>
    <Method Name="runManual" Id="{e784041c-96b2-4f08-8eb1-d3da22ea06a3}" FolderPath="Mandatory\">
      <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary
This method executes manual commands. It has to be overwritten for every node.
If the node should do nothing, return a 'SUCCESS'.
It should run endless until the manual mode is stopped via stop request or immediate stop.
This method is called automatically by the operation mode handler.

**attention**: If this method returns the state 'ERROR', the operation mode handler automatically disables the whole machine!

